{"id":"agradable","lemma":"agradable","pos":"adj","rank":703,"glosses":["agreeable, pleasant"],"ipa":"/aɡɾaˈdable/","forms":{"femininePlural":"agradables"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-agradable.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿El tiempo es agradable?","en":"Is the weather nice?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450046","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Son niños agradables.","en":"They're nice kids.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448916","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},null]},{"text":"Fue agradable hablar con usted.","en":"Nice talking with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460855","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"you (formal)"}]},{"text":"Algunas personas son más agradables que otras.","en":"Some people are nicer than others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587420","words":[{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"}]},{"text":"¡Qué agradable sorpresa!","en":"What a pleasant surprise!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/196015","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"surprise"}]}]}